  ok   -- last_turns=1000 -> 60 turns, call-for-call identical to the full read's tail
  ok   -- the no-argument read is the FULL read and labels itself as one
  ok   -- the fixture really does repeat exactly one message.id far from its first use
  ok   -- RESIDUAL PINNED: on a transcript that replays a message.id, the window and the full read disagree -- the full read merged the two occurrences into one turn at the earlier position. A property of collect_turns' key, not of the window; measured at 3 of 675 comparisons over 45 real transcripts
